Z||000009||87GT||06-04-2001||07:07 PM||||Thanks Cliff.  I was hoping somebody would see it my way.  I think people that do this sort of kit car thing to the fiero are not really Pontiac Fiero fans.  They are GT40 fans, ferrari fans etc., not Fiero fans.  I think it is a terrible dis-respect to the Pontiac Fiero.  Buy it for what it is and enjoy it.   ||||reg||1
